{
  "about": [
    "Every address a signed-in browser can land on: each GET row of src/server/route-table.ts that admits a cookie at the console stage, keyed by its route id (the one-workspace plan, slice S0).",
    "kind: page = a destination a person navigates to (a full page in the app); alias = only redirects, to `to` (`:name` is one path part); ceremony = a password, sign-in or one-time-secret step that stays its own document;",
    "data = not a page (JSON, files, sockets, feeds, a catch-all's not-found); mixed = a page or an alias depending on `when`.",
    "destinations = page rows + mixed rows. It must stay at or under ceiling.destinations: a slice that removes a page lowers the ceiling in the same change. Ceremonies are counted apart and are never in-place pages.",
    "src/server/destinations.test.ts fails when a route row has no entry here (declare new pages), when an entry names no row, and when a demo or an operator console answers a row differently from its kind."
  ],
